# Files executed/parsed by Windows tools MUST keep CRLF line endings.
# cmd.exe mis-executes goto/call in batch files with LF-only endings
# (execution resumes at wrong file offsets, silently skipping commands).
# "-text" disables ALL git line-ending conversion: the bytes committed to
# the repository (CRLF) are delivered unchanged to every checkout and to
# GitHub ZIP downloads.
*.bat -text
*.cmd -text
*.reg -text
*.vbs -text
7-zip/MTPE_sfx_config.txt -text
